  (text "USB-C input (5 V only, sink: 5k1 on CC1/CC2)"
    (at 21.27 26.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "23d508c5-47e7-5e71-9eaa-34ca21d451dd"))
  (text "VBUS feeds the boost converter and the 3.3 V LDO only.\nBudget from a 500 mA port: ESP32 ~250 mA avg (500 mA WiFi peaks),\nHV supply ~150 mA at 4 tubes. A USB-C source gives 1.5-3 A at 5V."
    (at 25 140 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e0cb545f-b71d-5b9d-951c-dc6ed5f45266"))
  (rectangle
    (start 185 25)
    (end 300 95)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "b9a2fd52-224a-566e-af09-43757a7601d4"))
  (text "3.3 V regulator"
    (at 186.27 26.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "d8d87905-ccb7-5b84-840e-8e0b5c843e8b"))
  (rectangle
    (start 185 105)
    (end 300 165)
    (stroke
      (width 0.15)
      (type dash))
    (fill
      (type none))
    (uuid "a63fa7a8-5ee5-56ab-9f5c-5277d423cba7"))
  (text "USB-UART (programming + serial log)"
    (at 186.27 106.27 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2 2) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "7e50fa6a-c403-567e-b7bb-5d3deeca2b82"))
  (text "CH340C runs from 3V3 (V3 tied to VCC) so TXD/RXD are 3.3 V logic.\nNet names are from the ESP32 side: U0RXD = ESP32 RXD0 (IO3)."
    (at 190 152 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5e4099b6-4e0a-53b1-a7f4-79601c4e7720"))
